{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52088","headline":"五言延庆殿集同赋花间鸟 · 太宗皇帝李世民","name":"五言延庆殿集同赋花间鸟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"露园芳蘂散，风树□鸎新。\n啼笑非忧乐，娇庄复对人。\n色映枝中锦，歌飞叶里尘。\n所嗟非久质，共视歇余春。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"太宗皇帝李世民","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52088.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52088","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}